  "title": "Broccoli with Rigatoni",
  "description": "Broccoli florets are sautéed in garlic, butter, and olive oil, simmered in broth, tossed with fresh basil and hot rigatoni, then sprinkled with Parmesan cheese.",
  "authors": [
